   Open-source firmware (USB CDC) and USB mass-storage bootloader for a
   6-channel latching relay board with per-channel current measurement,
   based on the NXP MC9S08JM60. The board itself is existing hardware;
   firmware, bootloader and host tools are MIT licensed.
